realm-fsod-{1,2,3}.wmap: private-server layouts, not authenticated official maps.
Source: wServer/realm/worlds/maps/world{1,2,3}.wmap at:
https://github.com/ossimc82/fabiano-swagger-of-doom/tree/6fd20aad4a7905b13f25389c68368a942a2b68cb

Install scripts/requirements-realm-maps.txt, then reproduce with
python3 scripts/import-realm-maps.py. Source Git blobs are pinned in that
script. Conversion drops unused elevation and locally rounds sharp road
bends, restoring vacated cells from the nearest source biome and clearing
scenery only in the new road footprint. Water, region markers and road
connectivity are retained. Runtime replaces arrival markers and clears four
connected coastal 3x3 pads, then applies bounded population and setpieces.

